WEBVTT

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:25.990
How can I tell you this?

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:37.100
How can I tell you this?

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:47.680
I cannot touch you

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:54.290
But I...

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:58.420
...can kill you

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:05.770
I'm so sad to say to you...

00:01:05.770 --> 00:01:10.570
...but don't put your face so close to me

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.080
Now I hear you say my name...

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:25.120
...so I cross the light to be with you

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.500
Hey, wait for me!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:42.070
Are you walking her home again, Kouta?

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.270
I can feel the love, whoo, whoo.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:47.480
You guys...

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:48.150
Bye!

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:50.750
I'm really getting sick of you
mocking me every day.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.080
Where are you taking her on today's date?

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:58.050
Don't let Saeki and the others bother you, Mai.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.920
Sure, I'm fine.

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:14.870
Your Voice.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:20.640
You know, Kouta, you don't have to
force yourself to walk home with me.

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.840
It's fine. I'm walking home with you
because I want to.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.020
What?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.920
Oh, nothing.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:35.290
C'mon, let's go.

00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:36.760
Yeah.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.260
Huh?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.660
Come here.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.510
He's so cute.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.440
Come on, Mai. Let's go.

00:03:21.440 --> 00:03:22.870
He's cute!

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.800
You know you can't keep it.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:33.120
Don't you remember the last time
you brought home a cat...

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.180
...and weren't allowed to keep it?

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.460
He's asking me to save him.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.690
What are you talking about?

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:45.300
I want to help him because he's
asking me to help him.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:49.200
Because he's just like me.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.240
Argh! Fine!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:11.260
Katayama
Apples

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.950
Can we keep him at your house?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:09.990
My mom will definitely say no.
We'll keep him at the temple.

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:11.260
Will he be okay there?

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.690
I'm sure it will work out.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:17.920
But don't go touching the cat so much.
You know how you are.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:21.930
Yeah, I know. Thank you, Kouta.

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:25.960
What is it?

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.830
I think it's a bell.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.700
A bell?

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.970
I hear it every now and then.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.200
You're imagining it.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.940
You think so?

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.020
It's just your imagination.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:45.010
SETO

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.490
Kouta, wake up.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:00.760
Kouta! Mai is here.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.580
Here.

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:25.100
Kitten Food

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.100
Can't we feed him leftovers from breakfast?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.100
No.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.200
My allowance is going to run out.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.640
Apparently human food isn't good for cats.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.740
It's too salty, for one thing.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:34.830
Really?

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.150
I like Blue.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.410
For what?

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.070
For his name.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:45.020
His eyes are like the sky.

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:48.680
They're so blue and clear.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.020
Sure, why not?

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:55.980
You have to be more attentive,
because you're his daddy.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.300
What do you mean?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.230
I'm his mommy, and you're his daddy.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:05.970
Which means, Blue is our child.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:07.270
What?!

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:08.700
It's the same thing.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:10.710
Uh, s-sure.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.220
<i>How to</i>
<i>choose</i>
<i>the right</i>
<i>food</i>

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:30.230
Hey, Kouta.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:31.400
Yeah?

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:35.860
We're gonna be playing soccer on the field
by the river. You're coming, right?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.470
Oh...

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:38.800
What is it?

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.930
I have an errand to run. I'm sorry.

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:45.880
<i>Health Newsletter</i>

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:46.400
Jeez. You're always hanging out
with Makihara now.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:51.280
<i>How to Care for Your Cat</i>

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:49.920
It's not like I'm having fun...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.280
Never mind.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.580
I won't ask you anymore.

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:57.620
If you want to be with Makihara that much,
you should marry her or something.

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:02.860
Let's go!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.230
Sure!
Let's go!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.630
You should go play with Saeki
and the others sometimes.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:17.130
I don't need to.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:20.580
Who cares about them?
I don't want to play with them anyway.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:25.620
I'm sorry.

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:26.520
Huh?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:29.280
This started after that time I fainted.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:34.130
That's when you started walking home with me.

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.530
That isn't why...

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:40.020
I understand how Saeki feels.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.500
He probably feels as though
I took you from him.

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.600
Hold on one second.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.380
Here it is.

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.300
Are you all right?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.560
Yeah...

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:17.430
Did you take the syrup? The medicine?

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.760
No...

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:22.000
You didn't take it? You know better.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.630
I couldn't. After 4th period...

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.900
...I took a nap in the nurse's office.

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.810
Jeez.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:29.940
I'm sorry.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.610
Why are you apologizing?

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.050
I'm sorry.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:36.950
I said, don't apologize.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:38.150
But I...

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.780
It's all right. You are who you are.

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.100
Let's go home.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.430
Yeah.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:50.530
H-hey. Wait, that's embarrassing!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:52.470
Nobody can see us.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:55.300
B-but... Uh, Blue is watching.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:59.580
So what? We're his mommy and daddy.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:01.340
Uh... Yeah...

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:03.470
Just a little longer.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.950
Okay, but only just a little longer.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.580
Thanks.

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:09.420
Did you hear that?

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.620
Yeah.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:12.390
It was a bell.

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:42.980
Makihara

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.080
Are you okay going by yourself?

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.290
Yeah, it's just an examination.

00:09:44.320 --> 00:09:47.590
Oh, please take care of Blue.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:50.500
Oh, sure. Leave him to me.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:52.760
I am his daddy, after all.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:09:56.730
See you.

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:31.190
What the?

00:10:33.370 --> 00:10:34.860
Blue?

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.770
Blue? Blue!

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.610
You've got to be kidding.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.820
Jeez, you're so hopeless.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:02.900
Kitten
Food

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:07.610
National Weather
Tomorrow's Weather

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:07.610
It should be clear nation-wide tomorrow,
and you will not need an umbrella.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:10.780
Say...

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:11.940
Hmm?

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.880
Would you increase my allowance?

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:16.010
What are you talking about?

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.220
It's not enough.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:19.880
You're getting plenty.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:24.620
I guess you have to eat every day, huh?

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:28.280
That goes without saying.
Now come on, eat your tomatoes.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.560
Good morning!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.640
Year 5
Class 2

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.010
Hey, did you do the homework?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.870
Yeah, how about you?

00:11:41.870 --> 00:11:42.840
Sort of, but...

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.640
Oh, no. The homework...

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:50.750
You can copy mine.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:51.620
Huh?

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:52.320
Take it.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:53.520
Take it.
Hey, let me see that!

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.890
Morning!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.520
Hasn't she come yet? This is bad!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.120
Thanks.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.030
Hey! But...

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.390
Don't be greedy.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:06.560
Don't take long!

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:13.470
Listen, we're having a game against
Class 3 after school today...

00:12:13.610 --> 00:12:15.940
...but we need more players.

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.540
I was wondering, can you come and play?

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.810
I'm sure we'll win if you play.

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:23.480
All right, I'll be there.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.940
For real? Right on!

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:30.360
SETO

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.980
So, I'm sorry. I have to be there.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:37.930
Sure, no problem. After all,
you took care of him yesterday.

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:37.930
MAKIHARA

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.330
I'm sorry.

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.400
You don't have to apologize.

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.890
Kouta!

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:45.670
Okay, thanks.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.370
Hey!

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:50.640
You can do it, Daddy.

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:52.910
Right!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.220
Let's go!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:57.550
We're gonna win for sure.
Let's go!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.140
We're gonna win for sure.
Yeah!

00:12:59.950 --> 00:13:01.590
It went that way!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.420
Get it!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.260
It's raining!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:21.310
You're hurting me.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.380
Get changed.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:27.280
Man, this is the worst. We were winning too.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.410
See you later, Blue.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.890
This is all I have. I'm sorry.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:56.030
Mommy has to go now.

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:11.380
<i>INCOMING</i>
<i>CALL</i>

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:14.420
Hello? Oh!

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:17.260
Yes...

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:20.390
Really? One moment, please.

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:23.400
Kouta?

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:29.800
It's Mai's mother...

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:32.430
...she wants to know if you know where she is.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:33.510
Huh?

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:36.080
She says she hasn't come home yet.

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:40.050
Kouta, what is it?

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.470
Mai's handkerchief.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:15.350
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:23.160
Seto

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.920
Makihara

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.150
It's your fault.

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.080
It's your fault for being there.

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:28.310
It's...

00:17:28.890 --> 00:17:30.680
It's not my f...

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.360
Are you trying to say that you're innocent?

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:51.370
What do you suppose will happen to him
if it continues to rain?

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.870
There's no need to suppose.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.980
He'll definitely die if you leave him here.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:06.160
Jeez. Are you trying to kill
one of my people, you brat?!

00:18:06.160 --> 00:18:08.030
Wh...

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:10.000
G... Ghosts?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.960
Who are you calling a ghost?

00:18:11.960 --> 00:18:15.830
She may not look it, but Momo here
is a bonafide Reaper!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.600
Reaper?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:25.370
REAPER

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.840
Reaper number 100100.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.920
You can call me "Momo".

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.640
What do you mean by "reaper"?

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.020
It means someone who gives death.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.760
Give death?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.790
More simply speaking,
it means someone who takes life.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:47.360
He has beautiful eyes.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.170
You're going to take Blue's life?

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:54.310
You don't mind if I take it, do you?

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:56.670
You can't possibly mind
if you're abandoning him here.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.750
Do it.

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:05.200
I don't care what happens to him anymore.

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.610
Oh, really?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.320
I really will kill him.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.860
Don't!

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:41.050
You must never forget how you feel right now.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:42.450
What?

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:46.320
For your own sake and for the sake
of the girl who named him "Blue."

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.760
How do you know about Mai?

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:55.000
As I explained, she is a reaper!

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:59.770
I came to take Mai's soul...

00:20:01.210 --> 00:20:03.940
...but she had regrets...

00:20:03.940 --> 00:20:06.270
...and she could not depart.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:12.240
She was worried about you and Blue.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.020
If you ever abandoned that little boy...

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.990
...she would not be happy up in Heaven.

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:25.690
But I can't look after him... all alone...

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.390
But you can.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.570
Mai?

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:38.100
I wanted to help him...

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:41.300
...just like you were always helping me.

00:20:43.420 --> 00:20:45.350
That little boy is me.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:49.110
So, I thought that if I could make him
grow up good and strong...

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.550
...I thought that I could get stronger too.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:56.860
But listen, Kouta, I don't regret it.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:59.160
I'm happy that I found Blue...

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.960
...and I'm glad that I got to spend time with you.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.800
Mai...

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:07.140
I'm no longer here...

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:09.570
...but please take care of Blue for me.

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:12.610
S-sure.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:15.140
I have to go.

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:17.410
See you...

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:22.620
...Kouta.

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:24.780
Mai?!

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:28.780
Mai...

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.100
You can do it, Daddy.

00:21:47.850 --> 00:21:49.640
Blue.

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:13.370
You're such a crybaby, Momo.

00:22:14.710 --> 00:22:17.040
The dead can't cry...

00:22:18.110 --> 00:22:21.640
...so I cry for them.

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:55.180
Born out of a deep sleep...

00:22:56.010 --> 00:23:03.440
...I wonder why can't I stop crying?

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:13.260
A gentle breeze blows through my white hair...

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:19.970
...conveying each and every little word

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:30.750
Within my arms are so many lives...

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:37.950
...so fleetingly, so lovingly extinguished

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:46.860
They dance white and high into the night sky...

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:55.140
...and I keep watch over them, ever vigilant

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:01.980
Next Episode

00:24:00.350 --> 00:24:02.550
The night sky is a pool without water.

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:06.550
Fish are always exploring outer
space in search of water.

00:24:06.550 --> 00:24:09.540
Next Episode:
"When We Were Fish."

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:13.930
This is the sad and sweet story
of a reaper in white.

00:24:11.860 --> 00:24:14.950
When We were Fish.
